    "slug": "split-learning-security",
    "title": "Secure split-learning admission",
    "description": "A client's request packet is scored by an AI risk ranker. Low-risk clients receive a risk-adapted Hashcash challenge. A correct and timely client solution admits the client to split learning. High-risk requests and invalid or late solutions enter a blocklist. The offline ranker pipeline uses CIC-IDS2017, recursive feature elimination, and TVAE-based data augmentation.",
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 600,
    "source_type": "paper",
